                            <div class="lf-row"><i>Address</i><b>4425 Sharon Rd</b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Phone</i><b><a href="tel:9805804848">(980) 580-4848</a></b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Insider tip</i><p class="tiptext">The dry-aged ribeye is the order; pair it with the truffle mac and cheese as the table side. Reservations are the move for any weekend or occasion dinner, as the room books out.</p></div>            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </details>
              </article>
      <div class="gmb2" data-after="r8"><div class="promotion-block promotion-guide" data-recommendation="Related"><span class="promotion-label">Related</span><a class="gmb" href="https://topofcharlotte.com/best-steakhouses-charlotte/"><img src="https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/best-steakhouses-in-charlotte-8-prime-spots-2026--300x167.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="104" height="70"><span class="gmb-t"><b>Best Steakhouses in Charlotte (2026)</b><em><span class="n1">&#8470; 1:</span> Steak 48</em></span></a></div><div class="promotion-block promotion-guide" data-recommendation="You may also like"><span class="promotion-label">You may also like</span><a class="gmb" href="https://topofcharlotte.com/best-mediterranean-food-charlotte/"><img src="https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/best-mediterranean-food-in-charlotte-2026--300x167.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="104" height="70"><span class="gmb-t"><b>Best Mediterranean Restaurants in Charlotte (2026)</b><em><span class="n1">&#8470; 1:</span> Kid Cashew</em></span></a></div></div>      <article class="lrow" id="r9" data-rank="9" data-hood="Charlotte" data-price="$$$" data-tags="Upscale Dining|Romantic Spot|Modern Setting">
        <div class="restaurant-overview">
        <div class="lr-ph">
          <span class="lr-no">9</span>
