            <span class="lr-score" aria-label="Insider Score 7.5 out of 10"><span>Insider Score</span><b>7.5</b></span>          </div>
          <p class="lr-hook">Midwood Smokehouse sits at the top of Charlotte&#039;s barbecue conversation in a city that has been sorting out what its own BBQ identity means.</p>          <span class="lr-order"><span class="u-lbl">What to order</span><span class="pl">Smoked Beef Brisket</span><span class="pl">Baby Back Ribs</span><span class="pl">Pulled Pork Platter</span></span>          <span class="lr-cta">
