        </details>
              </article>
      <div class="gmb2" data-after="r19"><div class="promotion-block promotion-guide" data-recommendation="You may also like"><span class="promotion-label">You may also like</span><a class="gmb" href="https://topofcharlotte.com/best-chicken-wings-charlotte/"><img src="https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/best-chicken-wings-charlotte-hero-300x167.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="104" height="70"><span class="gmb-t"><b>Best Chicken Wings Restaurants in Charlotte (2026)</b><em><span class="n1">&#8470; 1:</span> Lulu&#x27;s Maryland Style Chicken</em></span></a></div><div class="promotion-block promotion-guide" data-recommendation="You may also like"><span class="promotion-label">You may also like</span><a class="gmb" href="https://topofcharlotte.com/best-indian-food-charlotte/"><img src="https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/best-indian-food-in-charlotte-10-local-favorites-2026--300x167.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="104" height="70"><span class="gmb-t"><b>Best Indian Restaurants in Charlotte (2026)</b><em><span class="n1">&#8470; 1:</span> Curry Gate 2</em></span></a></div></div>      <article class="lrow" id="r20" data-rank="20" data-hood="Charlotte" data-price="$$" data-tags="Upscale Dining|Family Friendly|Romantic Spot">
        <div class="restaurant-overview">
        <div class="lr-ph">
          <span class="lr-no">20</span>
                    <img src="https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/21/99/a4/32/ny-strip.jpg" alt="Burtons Grill &amp; Bar" loading="lazy" width="600" height="450" decoding="async">
          <span class="lr-cred"><a href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="Burtons Grill &amp; Bar photo on Tripadvisor"><img src="https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/plugins/custom-business-directory/assets/images/tripadvisor-logo-dark-bg.svg" alt="Tripadvisor"></a></span>                  </div>
        <div class="lr-main">
          <div class="lr-hd">
            <div class="lr-tt">
              <h3 class="lr-name">Burtons Grill &amp; Bar</h3>
              <span class="lr-meta">New American &middot; Charlotte &middot; <span class="bb-pr">$$</span></span>
            </div>
            <span class="lr-score" aria-label="Insider Score 7.2 out of 10"><span>Insider Score</span><b>7.2</b></span>          </div>
          <p class="lr-hook">Burtons Grill &amp; Bar is the kind of moderately priced room that has figured out what Charlotte&#039;s banking-crowd and transplant base actually want on a Friday night: a polished, full-service operation that holds up under pressure.</p>          <span class="lr-order"><span class="u-lbl">What to order</span><span class="pl">Grilled Atlantic Salmon</span><span class="pl">Lobster Ravioli</span><span class="pl">Prime Ribeye Steak</span></span>          <span class="lr-cta">
                        <a class="u-btn secondary" href="tel:9802990999">Call</a>            <a class="u-btn secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&#038;destination=35.17261154120539%2C-80.84898563497028" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Directions</a>
          </span>
                  </div>
        </div>
                <details class="review-details">
          <summary aria-label="Review and visiting details for Burtons Grill &amp; Bar"><span class="when-closed">Read the full review &amp; visiting details</span><span class="when-open">Full review &amp; visiting details</span><span class="detail-indicator" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="lr-fold">
          <div class="lf-body">
            <h4 class="lf-hd2">Reliable New American for the Occasion That Counts</h4>                        <div class="lf-dishes">
              <div class="fd"><b>Grilled Atlantic Salmon</b><p>The salmon anchor on a New American menu built for steady weekend crowds, reliable enough to anchor a date-night order.</p></div><div class="fd"><b>Lobster Ravioli</b><p>Pasta as the room&#039;s comfort play, the kind of dish that earns repeat visits on a busy Saturday without demanding much from the diner.</p></div><div class="fd"><b>Prime Ribeye Steak</b><p>The ribeye is the table-setter here, the cut that signals Burtons is running a full grill program alongside its lighter New American fare.</p></div>            </div>
                        <div class="lf-prose"><p>Burtons Grill &amp; Bar is the kind of moderately priced room that has figured out what Charlotte's banking-crowd and transplant base actually want on a Friday night: a polished, full-service operation that holds up under pressure. The kitchen anchors the menu on three clear signatures. The Grilled Atlantic Salmon is the straightforward, well-executed center of the lineup, the sort of plate that earns repeat visits by doing the obvious thing correctly. Lobster Ravioli moves the room closer to special-occasion territory, a pasta dish that justifies the price point for couples putting in the effort. The Prime Ribeye Steak is the expense-account call, the kind of protein-forward order that this segment of Charlotte dining does reliably well.</p>
<p>Brunch is a genuine second act. The house donuts are the standout order at that daypart, the kind of detail that separates a kitchen running a real brunch program from one that treats Saturday morning as an afterthought. A raspberry mimosa rounds out the picture for the weekend crowd. The room runs busy on weekends, including Valentine's Night, when a party of five found space and attentive service despite full capacity. That the kitchen and floor hold together under that kind of volume is the operational story worth noting.</p>
<p>Charlotte did not have rooms like this in the 1980s. The city's appetite for polished, mid-to-upper-range New American dining is a product of the banking-boom years, the transplant wave, and the post-LYNX restaurant surge. Burtons fits that arc: not a chef-driven statement room in the way Counter- or Leah and Louise are, but a competent, consistent operator serving the date-night and special-occasion market that the city's demographics guarantee. For a room that runs full on Saturday nights and still keeps service attentive, the execution holds.</p>
</div>
          </div>
          <div class="lf-rail">
                        <a class="lf-map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&#038;destination=35.17261154120539%2C-80.84898563497028" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" aria-label="Directions to Burtons Grill &amp; Bar"><img src="https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/uploads/rowmaps/405.webp" alt="Map showing Burtons Grill &amp; Bar" loading="lazy" width="300" height="200"><span class="osm">&copy; OpenStreetMap</span></a>
                        <div class="lf-rows">
