                            <div class="lf-row"><i>Address</i><b>1601 E Woodlawn Rd</b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Phone</i><b><a href="tel:9802990999">(980) 299-0999</a></b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Insider tip</i><p class="tiptext">Saturday brunch is the lower-stakes entry point: the donuts are the move at that daypart, and the room, though busy, keeps service steady. For dinner, the Lobster Ravioli reads as the kitchen&#039;s clearest bid for the occasion.</p></div>            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </details>
              </article>
      <div class="featwrap" data-after="r20"><a class="v6-feat v6-feat--adx" href="https://topofcharlotte.com/guides/"><span class="v6-feat__im" style="background-image:url(https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/charlotte-t50hero-1024x572.webp);background-position:center"></span><span class="v6-adx__tx"><span class="v6-adx__k">The Guides</span><b class="v6-adx__h">Every guide, one index.</b><i class="v6-adx__b">Cuisines, occasions, neighborhoods, all ranked.</i><span class="v6-feat__btn" style="background:#c02a20;color:#ffffff">Browse the guides</span></span></a><script>if(window.cbdRot)cbdRot(document.currentScript,"list-inline-20",[["advertise-trow","p:\/advertise","advertise",6],["tickets-city-trow","p:\/event-tickets","tickets",100],["u-lsn-trow","h:localsinglesnear.com","dating",100],["u-wi-trow","h:webigniter.com","marketing",100]])</script></div>      <article class="lrow" id="r21" data-rank="21" data-hood="Concord" data-price="$$" data-tags="Upscale Dining|Modern Setting|Local Favorite">
