          <span class="lr-cred"><a href="https://www.yelp.com/biz/44-mills-kitchen-tap-concord?adjust_creative=ncSIOsUpFaM6ZuPenKQYtw&#038;utm_campaign=yelp_api_v3&#038;utm_medium=api_v3_business_search&#038;utm_source=ncSIOsUpFaM6ZuPenKQYtw" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" aria-label="44 Mills Kitchen + Tap photo on Yelp"><img src="https://topofcharlotte.com/wp-content/plugins/custom-business-directory/assets/images/yelp-logo-dark-bg.svg" alt="Yelp"></a></span>
