          <div class="lr-hd">
            <div class="lr-tt">
              <h3 class="lr-name">44 Mills Kitchen + Tap</h3>
              <span class="lr-meta">New American &middot; Concord &middot; <span class="bb-pr">$$</span></span>
            </div>
            <span class="lr-score" aria-label="Insider Score 7.2 out of 10"><span>Insider Score</span><b>7.2</b></span>          </div>
          <p class="lr-hook">Concord has spent the better part of two decades watching Charlotte build its restaurant scene from scratch, and rooms like 44 Mills Kitchen + Tap represent the suburban side of that same project: a moderately priced New American kitchen that punches above its zip code.</p>          <span class="lr-order"><span class="u-lbl">What to order</span><span class="pl">Pan-Seared Salmon</span><span class="pl">Braised Short Ribs</span><span class="pl">Shrimp and Grits</span></span>          <span class="lr-cta">
