                            <div class="lf-row"><i>Address</i><b>1212 The Plz<br>Charlotte, NC, 28205</b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Phone</i><b><a href="tel:7048177514">(704) 817-7514</a></b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Insider tip</i><p class="tiptext">The bar offshoot offers walk-in access on nights when the main room is fully committed; the beverage program is the Michelin-recognized anchor, so ordering around it is not an afterthought. For dinner, the dry-aged ribeye and buttermilk fried chicken represent the kitchen at its most deliberate.</p></div>            </div>
          </div>
