                            <div class="lf-row"><i>Address</i><b>4310 Sharon Rd</b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Phone</i><b><a href="tel:7043651922">(704) 365-1922</a></b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Insider tip</i><p class="tiptext">The crab rangoon dip is the consensus opener and worth the table space. For the full concept, order one Burgushi and one conventional roll side by side to understand what the kitchen is actually doing.</p></div>            </div>
