            <span class="lr-score" aria-label="Insider Score 6.9 out of 10"><span>Insider Score</span><b>6.9</b></span>          </div>
          <p class="lr-hook">The name does nothing to telegraph what New Zealand Cafe actually is, which is a moderately priced Charlotte sushi and hibachi spot that has built a neighborhood following on rolls and grilled fish rather than any obvious regional identity.</p>          <span class="lr-order"><span class="u-lbl">What to order</span><span class="pl">Dragon Roll</span><span class="pl">Hibachi Salmon</span><span class="pl">Spicy Tuna Crispy Rice</span></span>          <span class="lr-cta">
                        <a class="u-btn secondary" href="tel:7047089888">Call</a>            <a class="u-btn secondary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&#038;destination=35.140625%2C-80.737637" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Directions</a>
