                            <div class="lf-row"><i>Hours</i><b>Mon - Thu: 11:30 AM - 11:00 PM</b><b>Fri - Sat: 11:30 AM - 12:00 AM</b><b>Sun: 11:30 AM - 11:00 PM</b></div>
                            <div class="lf-row"><i>Address</i><b>1400 S Church St</b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Phone</i><b><a href="tel:9802994389">(980) 299-4389</a></b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Insider tip</i><p class="tiptext">Galbi short ribs are the priority order; move through multiple rounds rather than loading the first round heavy. Resolve parking before leaving the table so the validation issue does not surface at the meter.</p></div>            </div>
          </div>
