            <span class="lr-score" aria-label="Insider Score 6.8 out of 10"><span>Insider Score</span><b>6.8</b></span>          </div>
          <p class="lr-hook">131 MAIN sits in the register Charlotte&#039;s banking-money crowd built the market for: upscale, polished, the kind of room that works for a closing dinner or a significant anniversary without requiring either party to explain why they&#039;re there.</p>          <span class="lr-order"><span class="u-lbl">What to order</span><span class="pl">Pan-Seared Salmon with Seasonal Vegetables</span><span class="pl">Dry-Aged Ribeye Steak</span><span class="pl">Lobster Risotto</span></span>          <span class="lr-cta">
