                            <div class="lf-row"><i>Address</i><b>214 N Tryon St</b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Phone</i><b><a href="tel:7043449222">(704) 344-9222</a></b></div>              <div class="lf-row"><i>Insider tip</i><p class="tiptext">The risotto specials rotate and have drawn stronger responses than almost anything on the standing menu; ask what is running before ordering. The pre-theater window works, but the room is dim enough that arriving unhurried is the better call.</p></div>            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </details>
