            <div class="qa"><h3>Best upscale restaurants in Charlotte</h3>
    <p><a href="#r2">Yunta Nikkei</a> (Peruvian, 8.1) leads this week, followed by <a href="#r6">The Cellar at Duckworth&#039;s</a> (Gastropubs, 7.7) and <a href="#r7">The Fig Tree Restaurant</a> (New American, 7.5).</p></div>
            <div class="qa"><h3>Best family restaurants in Charlotte</h3>
    <p><a href="#r1">Curry Gate 2</a> (Indian, 8.1) leads this week, followed by <a href="#r3">Kabab-Je Rotisserie &amp; Grille</a> (Lebanese, 7.9) and <a href="#r4">Ace No 3 - Belmont Village</a> (Burgers, 7.8).</p></div>
            <div class="qa"><h3>Best modern restaurants in Charlotte</h3>
